[{"text": "In accordance with resolution 81 of", "start": 0.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "September", "start": 4.319, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "17th, 2026,", "start": 6.0, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "I give the floor to the distinguished", "start": 8.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "observer of the observer state of", "start": 11.679, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "Palestine to introduce an address by the", "start": 14.24, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "head of state.", "start": 17.6, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": ">> Mr. President,", "start": 20.88, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 23.519, "duration": 7.441}, {"text": "I have the honor to present a", "start": 27.199, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "pre-recorded video statement by His", "start": 30.96, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "Excellency", "start": 33.52, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Mahmud Abbas, President of the State of", "start": 35.04, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Palestine,", "start": 37.84, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "addressing the general debate of the", "start": 39.44, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "81st session of the General Assembly", "start": 42.719, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "pursuant to General Assembly Resolution", "start": 46.48, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "A/ /res", "start": 50.239, "duration": 6.121}, {"text": "81.", "start": 53.36, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Thank you Mr. President.", "start": 56.559, "duration": 3.961}, {"text": ">> In the name of Allah the most gracious,", "start": 65.36, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "the most merciful. Excellency Dr. Khalil", "start": 67.2, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Rahman, President of the General", "start": 70.479, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "Assembly.", "start": 72.159, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Excellency Mr. Antonio Guterish,", "start": 74.64, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Secretary General of the United Nations.", "start": 77.439, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 79.92, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "heads and members of delegations,", "start": 81.92, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "for the second consecutive year,", "start": 86.0, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "the Palestinian delegation was denied", "start": 89.04, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "the entry visas required", "start": 91.759, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "to reach New York and participate in the", "start": 95.92, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "meetings of the United Nations General", "start": 98.64, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "Assembly in person.", "start": 100.72, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "We reject these unlawful punitive", "start": 105.68, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "measures.", "start": 108.56, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "and we reject the accusations and", "start": 111.119, "duration": 6.761}, {"text": "justifications on which they were based.", "start": 113.2, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "We affirm that we have fulfilled our", "start": 117.92, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "obligations,", "start": 119.759, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "carried out a comprehensive national", "start": 122.159, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "reform program,", "start": 124.56, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "and upheld our commitment to", "start": 127.92, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "international law,", "start": 129.52, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "to shunning violence and terrorism,", "start": 132.48, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and to the two-state solution,", "start": 135.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "and to peace on the basis of resolutions", "start": 138.48, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "of international legitimacy.", "start": 140.959, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "We also affirm that the Palestinian", "start": 144.8, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "people and its leadership should not be", "start": 147.76, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "punished", "start": 150.4, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "for demanding an end for the occupation", "start": 152.8, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "or for turning to the UN,", "start": 156.16, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "the International Court of Justice", "start": 160.0, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "and the International Criminal Court.", "start": 163.12, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "Our choice to invoke international law", "start": 167.2, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "and its institutions is a peaceful and", "start": 169.519, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "civilized choice and not an act that", "start": 172.16, "duration": 6.439}, {"text": "runs counter to peace.", "start": 174.72, "duration": 3.879}, {"text": "Denying the Palestinian delegation", "start": 179.2, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "access to the UN headquarters", "start": 181.28, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "is a violation of the UN of the United", "start": 184.879, "duration": 8.44}, {"text": "States obligations as the host country.", "start": 187.92, "duration": 5.399}, {"text": "Therefore, we call upon the American", "start": 194.72, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "administration", "start": 196.4, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "to lift these sanctions and", "start": 199.44, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "restrictions,", "start": 200.879, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "return to dialogue and mutual respect,", "start": 203.599, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "and work with us and with the", "start": 208.56, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "international community in order to", "start": 210.08, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "implement the two-state solution on the", "start": 212.319, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "basis of international legitimacy", "start": 215.12, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "and to establish peace rather than", "start": 218.4, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "punishing the side that has chosen the", "start": 221.04, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "path of international law and political", "start": 223.599, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "and diplomatic action in order to", "start": 226.64, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "guarantee its rights.", "start": 229.2, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "Mr. President, esteemed member states,", "start": 237.519, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "I speak to you today as the Palestinian", "start": 242.64, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "people faces one of the most dangerous", "start": 244.959, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "times of its history.", "start": 247.599, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "This is following long decades of", "start": 251.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "historic injustice, uprooting, asylum", "start": 253.2, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "seeking, occupation, and the deprivation", "start": 256.72, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "of its basic right to", "start": 259.68, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "self-determination, freedom, and", "start": 261.04, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "independence.", "start": 263.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "In the Gaza Strip,", "start": 266.0, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "our people are being subjected at the", "start": 268.88, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "hands of the Israeli occupation forces", "start": 271.28, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "to killing, destruction, starvation, and", "start": 273.759, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "attempts at displacement, as well as a", "start": 277.199, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "genocidal war that has created an", "start": 279.68, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "unprecedented humanitarian catastrophe.", "start": 283.759, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "It has destroyed neighborhoods, cities,", "start": 288.08, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "camps, institutions, schools,", "start": 291.12, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "universities,", "start": 294.56, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "hospitals,", "start": 296.24, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "mosques and churches", "start": 299.759, "duration": 3.801}, {"text": "and it has targeted all the basic", "start": 303.919, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "necessities of life and the future of", "start": 305.84, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "entire generations", "start": 307.919, "duration": 3.481}, {"text": "in the West Bank including East", "start": 311.52, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Jerusalem.", "start": 313.44, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Settler expansion is accelerating.", "start": 316.4, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "The West Bank is being fragmented and", "start": 319.84, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Jerusalem is being isolated and", "start": 322.4, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "Judaized.", "start": 324.72, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Settler terrorism is escalating under", "start": 326.56, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "the protection of the occupying forces.", "start": 328.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "While the crimes of land theft, home", "start": 331.28, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "demolition, checkpoints, and raids", "start": 334.16, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "continue", "start": 338.08, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "under a system of laws, measures, and", "start": 340.0, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "practices.", "start": 342.88, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "all built on racial discrimination,", "start": 345.759, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "ethnic cleansing, and state terrorism.", "start": 348.08, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 352.72, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "we have long warned the international", "start": 356.0, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "community through the United Nations", "start": 357.919, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "General Assembly and through the", "start": 360.24, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Security Council that these Israeli", "start": 362.32, "duration": 5.999}, {"text": "policies in violation of international", "start": 365.36, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "law would destroy the two-state", "start": 368.319, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "solution. And that this is what and this", "start": 370.8, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "is what is happening now.", "start": 373.84, "duration": 3.28}, {"text": "Today we warn of an even greater danger", "start": 378.96, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "ahead. One that requires international", "start": 381.36, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "action to address it.", "start": 384.08, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "The danger is no longer limited to", "start": 387.52, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "undermining the two-state solution and", "start": 389.12, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "preventing the realization of the", "start": 391.199, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Palestinian state. It has now come to", "start": 392.96, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "threaten the very life and existence of", "start": 395.919, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "the Palestinian people on their", "start": 397.919, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "homeland.", "start": 399.919, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "What is taking place in Gaza, the West", "start": 404.24, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Bank, and East Jerusalem are not", "start": 406.479, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "isolated incidents, but rather a", "start": 408.88, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "malicious colonial scheme aimed at", "start": 411.84, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "making the lives of Palestinians more", "start": 414.4, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "difficult in their homeland", "start": 416.479, "duration": 7.961}, {"text": "and forcing them to leave it.", "start": 420.0, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "We warn you today,", "start": 427.199, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "do not allow another neckba to occur. Do", "start": 430.4, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "not allow further massacres like those", "start": 434.0, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "that occurred in 1948.", "start": 436.479, "duration": 3.961}, {"text": "Do not allow terrorist gangs protected", "start": 441.52, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "by the Israeli occupation forces to burn", "start": 444.0, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Palestinian homes while their occupants", "start": 447.52, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "are sleeping inside them.", "start": 450.4, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Do not allow our children to live afraid", "start": 453.599, "duration": 6.121}, {"text": "and threatened.", "start": 456.4, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "Once again, I ask before this assembly,", "start": 460.479, "duration": 4.521}, {"text": "how much longer will some states", "start": 465.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "continue to remain silent on Israel or", "start": 467.199, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "supply it with the weapons that it uses", "start": 470.0, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "against our people?", "start": 472.56, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "The world has witnessed the tremendous", "start": 478.16, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "cost in the Gaza Strip and the West", "start": 480.16, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "Bank.", "start": 482.319, "duration": 3.521}, {"text": "So what is the international community", "start": 483.84, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "waiting for in order to protect the", "start": 485.84, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Palestinian people, ensure their", "start": 487.84, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "continued presence on their land and the", "start": 490.56, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Israeli occupation and implement the", "start": 493.36, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "two-state solution on the basis of", "start": 495.84, "duration": 6.039}, {"text": "international legitimacy.", "start": 498.4, "duration": 3.479}, {"text": "This solution guarantees peace for all", "start": 502.24, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "instead of the threat emanating from", "start": 505.599, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Israeli extremism", "start": 508.08, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "which seeks to expand its colonial", "start": 510.639, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "project", "start": 512.88, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "towards establishing the so-called", "start": 515.36, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "greater Israel", "start": 518.08, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "and completely erasing Palestinian", "start": 521.2, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "presence.", "start": 523.2, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President esteemed member states.", "start": 526.88, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "We welcomed President Donald Trump's", "start": 531.36, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "20point plan.", "start": 533.6, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "We also welcomed Security Council", "start": 537.519, "duration": 5.801}, {"text": "resolution 2803", "start": 539.44, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "and the road map for implementing the", "start": 543.36, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "second phase. This was to halt the", "start": 545.279, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "aggression against our people", "start": 547.839, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "and their humanitarian suffering", "start": 550.56, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "and secure the withdrawal of the", "start": 553.44, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "occupation forces from the Gaza Strip", "start": 555.279, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "and begin rebuilding the Gaza Strip.", "start": 557.76, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "However, regretfully, we have not seen", "start": 561.839, "duration": 7.321}, {"text": "any of this materialize on the ground.", "start": 564.24, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "The Israeli killing and aggression", "start": 570.56, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "continue to claim the lives of men,", "start": 572.8, "duration": 6.76}, {"text": "women, and children in Gaza.", "start": 575.12, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "Nearly a year has passed since the", "start": 580.959, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "adoption of resolution 2803 and the", "start": 583.6, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "establishment of the board of peace.", "start": 587.2, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "and only one year remains of the", "start": 591.519, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "designated transitional period before", "start": 594.24, "duration": 6.279}, {"text": "the end of 2027.", "start": 596.48, "duration": 4.039}, {"text": "Therefore, we call for accelerating the", "start": 601.92, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "implementation of the second phase", "start": 603.839, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "rather than wasting any more time. The", "start": 606.0, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "transitional period must not be allowed", "start": 608.8, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "to become a permanent or open-ended", "start": 611.279, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "situation without any clear timebound", "start": 614.32, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "political horizon.", "start": 617.839, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Rather, it must lead to the", "start": 620.399, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "reunification of the Gaza Strip and the", "start": 622.64, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "West Bank, including East Jerusalem,", "start": 624.88, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "under the authority of the state of", "start": 627.6, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Palestine and its legitimate", "start": 629.92, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "institutions in accordance with the", "start": 631.92, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "principle of, one state, one government,", "start": 634.399, "duration": 9.361}, {"text": "one law, and one legitimate entity", "start": 640.16, "duration": 7.56}, {"text": "authorized to bear arms.", "start": 643.76, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen, esteemed member", "start": 648.24, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "states,", "start": 650.88, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "the threats and attacks carried out by", "start": 652.959, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "extremists", "start": 655.519, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "against Islamic and Christian holy", "start": 658.72, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "sites, particularly al axa mosque and", "start": 660.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "the church of the holy supplr in", "start": 664.399, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "Jerusalem and the Ibrahimi mosque in", "start": 666.48, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Hebron constitute a violation of their", "start": 669.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "historic and legal status and of freedom", "start": 672.16, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "of worship.", "start": 674.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "They must seize immediately before they", "start": 676.959, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "devolve", "start": 680.16, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "into a broader religious conflict in the", "start": 682.399, "duration": 6.521}, {"text": "region and beyond.", "start": 685.2, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "No one is in need of such an outcome.", "start": 689.2, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "The ongoing Israeli attacks on United", "start": 693.92, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Nations headquarters and institutions in", "start": 696.8, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "Jerusalem and the West Bank also", "start": 699.36, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "undermine Enru's ability", "start": 702.079, "duration": 9.361}, {"text": "to continue carrying out its duties", "start": 706.64, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "in providing support and assistance to", "start": 711.44, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Palestinian refugees,", "start": 713.68, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "especially in the fields of education,", "start": 716.8, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "healthcare, and vocational training.", "start": 719.04, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "We call upon all states and", "start": 724.16, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "international and regional organizations", "start": 726.639, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "to continue supporting the work of ENROA", "start": 729.519, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "for which there is no substitute so long", "start": 732.24, "duration": 8.279}, {"text": "as the refugee issue remains unresolved.", "start": 735.36, "duration": 5.159}, {"text": "This requires the continued financial", "start": 741.279, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "support and political backing", "start": 744.8, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "as well as an end to these attacks", "start": 749.2, "duration": 5.319}, {"text": "against Anra.", "start": 751.279, "duration": 3.24}, {"text": "We particularly warn also", "start": 756.639, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "against the implementation of the E1", "start": 760.32, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "settlement plan.", "start": 762.72, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "This plan aims to separate the northern", "start": 765.12, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "West Bank from its south, isolate", "start": 767.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "East Jerusalem from its Palestinian", "start": 771.279, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "surroundings, and prevent the", "start": 773.2, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "realization of a geographically", "start": 775.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "continuous Palestinian state.", "start": 778.079, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "This requires urgent and responsible", "start": 781.68, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "intervention by the United Nations", "start": 784.32, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "Security Council.", "start": 786.32, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "It also requires the implementation of", "start": 788.48, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Security Council resolution 2334.", "start": 790.639, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "2334.", "start": 794.8, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "This resolution calls for the cessation", "start": 797.68, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "of all settlement activities in the", "start": 799.839, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "occupied Palestinian territory,", "start": 802.72, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "including East Jerusalem.", "start": 805.2, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "We highly appreciate the measures taken", "start": 813.279, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "by the United Kingdom", "start": 815.68, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "as well as 12 other countries in order", "start": 819.2, "duration": 7.96}, {"text": "to protect the two-state solution", "start": 822.639, "duration": 4.521}, {"text": "as well as to ban settlement products.", "start": 828.88, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "We also commend the call launched by the", "start": 832.48, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "leaders of France, the United Kingdom,", "start": 834.56, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "and Canada to convene a summit in New", "start": 836.56, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "York on this matter. Furthermore, we", "start": 838.8, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "call upon President Trump to fulfill the", "start": 841.6, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "commitments he made to the leaders of", "start": 843.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "the Arab and Islamic states last", "start": 846.72, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "September.", "start": 848.959, "duration": 5.081}, {"text": "Last September", "start": 850.72, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "to prevent the annexation of Palestinian", "start": 854.079, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "land and to reject displacement.", "start": 856.16, "duration": 4.119}, {"text": "Mr. President, excellencies,", "start": 860.56, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "it is impossible to separate Israel's", "start": 863.92, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "land seure practices from the", "start": 866.399, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "dismantling of Palestinian institutions", "start": 868.48, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "and the depletion of its financial", "start": 871.199, "duration": 5.401}, {"text": "resources.", "start": 873.6, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "All of these are tools that lead to one", "start": 877.279, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "same result,", "start": 879.68, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "weakening our people's ability to remain", "start": 881.76, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "steadfast and stay on their land.", "start": 884.32, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "This leads to undermining our people's", "start": 888.959, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "national institutions and preventing the", "start": 891.12, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "realization of its state. The Israeli", "start": 893.36, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "government is withholding", "start": 896.16, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "more than $6 billion dollars", "start": 900.079, "duration": 8.12}, {"text": "that belong to the Palestinian people.", "start": 903.76, "duration": 4.439}, {"text": "We are demanding the immediate release", "start": 909.04, "duration": 8.84}, {"text": "of all our withheld funds,", "start": 913.36, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "the guarantee of their regular and full", "start": 918.8, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "transfer", "start": 921.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "and the lifting of the financial and", "start": 924.399, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "economic restrictions and the blockade", "start": 926.56, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "imposed on our people and our", "start": 929.36, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "institutions in accordance with the", "start": 931.6, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "Paris economic protocol which was agreed", "start": 933.92, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "upon following the Oslo Convention.", "start": 937.519, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "Mr. President, ladies and gentlemen, one", "start": 942.24, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "year after the International Peace", "start": 944.639, "duration": 3.281}, {"text": "Conference and the adoption of the New", "start": 946.399, "duration": 3.281}, {"text": "York declaration,", "start": 947.92, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "I say to you today with full confidence", "start": 949.68, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "and responsibility,", "start": 952.16, "duration": 6.84}, {"text": "we have fulfilled our pledge.", "start": 954.56, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "We have fulfilled our pledge.", "start": 959.12, "duration": 4.279}, {"text": "We completed the national reform program", "start": 963.44, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "to which we had committed before our", "start": 965.68, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "people and the international community.", "start": 968.079, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "We strengthened institutional", "start": 971.6, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "governance, public financial management,", "start": 973.279, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "transparency, accountability,", "start": 976.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "anti-corruption measures, and the rule", "start": 979.12, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "of law.", "start": 981.68, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "We established a unified needs-based", "start": 983.519, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "national system for social protection", "start": 986.32, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "and social welfare.", "start": 988.32, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "abolished the previous laws and", "start": 992.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "regulations on this matter", "start": 994.72, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "and obtained an independent", "start": 998.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "international audit", "start": 1000.8, "duration": 8.12}, {"text": "confirming the validity of our measures.", "start": 1003.839, "duration": 5.081}, {"text": "We also continue to reform the education", "start": 1009.92, "duration": 7.4}, {"text": "system and develop criteria", "start": 1012.72, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "and curricula in accordance with", "start": 1017.44, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "international standards and in", "start": 1019.6, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "cooperation with UNESCO in a manner that", "start": 1021.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "promotes the values of peace, tolerance", "start": 1024.079, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "and respect for others while preserving", "start": 1026.48, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "our national identity and the rights of", "start": 1028.799, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "our people.", "start": 1030.64, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "We also proceeded along the path of", "start": 1033.039, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "democratic revival and the empowerment", "start": 1035.52, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "of women and youth.", "start": 1037.52, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "We have held local council elections and", "start": 1040.88, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "elections for the general union of", "start": 1043.679, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "Palestinian students. We are headed", "start": 1045.28, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "towards our legislative elections on the", "start": 1047.839, "duration": 8.441}, {"text": "28th of November of this year", "start": 1050.559, "duration": 5.721}, {"text": "and this will be followed by the", "start": 1056.48, "duration": 2.72}, {"text": "completion of the renewal of the", "start": 1057.84, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "institutions of the Palestinian National", "start": 1059.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Council followed by the Palestinian", "start": 1061.36, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "presidential elections.", "start": 1064.72, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "On behalf of the state of Palestine, I", "start": 1067.6, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "reaffirm the commitments in which we", "start": 1069.6, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "believe. We seek security and peace for", "start": 1071.679, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "all.", "start": 1074.559, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "We reject attacks against civilians by", "start": 1077.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "any party whatsoever.", "start": 1079.76, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "We reject terrorism and extremism in all", "start": 1082.72, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "their forms.", "start": 1085.28, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "We combat anti-semitism, racism, and", "start": 1088.08, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "hatred.", "start": 1091.28, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "And we believe in a culture of peace,", "start": 1094.08, "duration": 6.599}, {"text": "dialogue, and coexistence.", "start": 1096.48, "duration": 4.199}, {"text": "We seek a democratic Palestinian state", "start": 1104.32, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "that respects the rule of law and human", "start": 1109.76, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "rights.", "start": 1112.0, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "A non-militarized state, a", "start": 1114.64, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "non-militarized state that lives in", "start": 1117.12, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "security and peace alongside the state", "start": 1119.6, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "of Israel.", "start": 1121.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Is this possible?", "start": 1124.0, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen, our commitment to", "start": 1127.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "peace did not begin today.", "start": 1129.28, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "In 1988,", "start": 1134.64, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "our people and its leadership made a", "start": 1136.88, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "historic and difficult decision", "start": 1138.799, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "and we accepted a historic settlement", "start": 1142.4, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "founded on the two-state solution on the", "start": 1144.4, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "basis of international legitimacy.", "start": 1146.96, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "Today we say to the world,", "start": 1150.32, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "saving the solution begins with", "start": 1153.919, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "preserving the land on which the", "start": 1156.32, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "Palestinian state is to be established", "start": 1158.08, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "and protecting the people who live on", "start": 1160.16, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "it.", "start": 1162.24, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "The Palestinian people will remain on", "start": 1165.84, "duration": 5.719}, {"text": "its land.", "start": 1168.32, "duration": 3.239}, {"text": "The Palestinian people will not accept", "start": 1171.6, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "displacement. Will not accept", "start": 1174.16, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "displacement and will not disappear.", "start": 1176.48, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "Neither military occupation nor", "start": 1179.679, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "settlement expansion, annexation, nor", "start": 1181.919, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "settler terrorism can be a solution or", "start": 1185.12, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "create lasting security.", "start": 1187.76, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "At the same time,", "start": 1191.28, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "we will not remain in waiting, nor will", "start": 1193.76, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "we accept whatever the governments of", "start": 1196.08, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "the Israeli occupying state decide for", "start": 1198.0, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "us. They have no right to decide for us.", "start": 1200.48, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "No lasting security can be built upon", "start": 1205.52, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "the occupation of another people and the", "start": 1207.76, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "denial of its legitimate rights.", "start": 1210.4, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "We have our own national project.", "start": 1214.16, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Protecting our people from displacement,", "start": 1218.96, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "preserving our land and its unity,", "start": 1221.52, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "democratically renewing our", "start": 1224.32, "duration": 3.359}, {"text": "institutions,", "start": 1226.08, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "and building our state while remaining", "start": 1227.679, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "committed to international law and", "start": 1230.24, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "exercising our right to", "start": 1232.64, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "self-determination,", "start": 1234.08, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "leading to the realization of an", "start": 1236.48, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "independent sovereign Palestinian state", "start": 1238.24, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "with East Jerusalem as its capital,", "start": 1240.72, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "along with the return of refugees in", "start": 1243.84, "duration": 7.64}, {"text": "accordance with UN resolution 94.", "start": 1245.84, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "We do not want a new process for", "start": 1256.32, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "managing the conflict while the face of", "start": 1258.32, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "the land changes every day.", "start": 1260.48, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "We want a process that puts an end to", "start": 1263.44, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "occupation and guarantees freedom and", "start": 1265.679, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "self-determination for Palestinians.", "start": 1268.559, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "A process that guarantees also security", "start": 1272.799, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "and peace for Israelis in the countries", "start": 1275.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "of the region. Our vision for peace is", "start": 1277.039, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "clear.", "start": 1280.24, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "A Palestinian people remaining on its", "start": 1281.76, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "own land, determining its future for", "start": 1283.919, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "itself. And the Palestinian state", "start": 1286.48, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "alongside the state of Israel. And a", "start": 1289.039, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Palestinian Israeli peace that paves the", "start": 1291.919, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "way to regional integration,", "start": 1294.799, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "cooperation, prosperity, and security", "start": 1296.799, "duration": 6.841}, {"text": "for everyone.", "start": 1300.32, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "Mr. President, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 1303.84, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "we thank all the countries and peoples", "start": 1307.36, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "that have stood by our people.", "start": 1310.24, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "We thank countries and peoples that have", "start": 1313.679, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "lent political, humanitarian, and", "start": 1315.52, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "economic support and helped us preserve", "start": 1318.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "our institutions and provide relief to", "start": 1320.48, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "our people.", "start": 1322.88, "duration": 3.24}, {"text": "We also thank the countries that have", "start": 1326.799, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "recognized the state of Palestine, which", "start": 1328.48, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "now number 160 states.", "start": 1331.28, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "and we call on those countries that have", "start": 1334.799, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "not yet recognized the state of", "start": 1336.64, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Palestine to do so.", "start": 1338.159, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "We likewise call for granting the state", "start": 1342.08, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "of Palestine full membership in the", "start": 1344.64, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "United Nations", "start": 1346.88, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "similar to the rest of the nations and", "start": 1349.44, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "peoples of the world.", "start": 1351.2, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "Finally,", "start": 1354.96, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "I address the sons and daughters of our", "start": 1358.799, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "Palestinian people in their homeland and", "start": 1360.96, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "in the diaspora.", "start": 1363.44, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "You have painted the greatest picture of", "start": 1367.76, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "pride and dignity by holding steadfastly", "start": 1369.76, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "onto your land, your unity, and your", "start": 1373.679, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "legitimate rights.", "start": 1376.72, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "We will not leave our homeland.", "start": 1379.36, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "We will not accept displacement", "start": 1382.08, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and we will not allow anyone to decide", "start": 1385.2, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "our future on our behalf. We decide for", "start": 1387.52, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "ourselves. We will extend our hands to a", "start": 1390.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "peace based on international legitimacy", "start": 1394.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "so that our freedom and independence can", "start": 1396.48, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "be achieved and so that everyone in the", "start": 1398.88, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "region everyone in the region may live", "start": 1401.52, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "in security, peace and good", "start": 1404.32, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "neighborliness.", "start": 1406.88, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "Peace be upon you all and the mercy of", "start": 1409.2, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "Allah and his blessings.", "start": 1410.96, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 1423.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "thank the president of the state of", "start": 1426.4, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "Palestine.", "start": 1428.88, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "The assembly", "start": 1434.0, "duration": 2.799}]